  "solution": "**FORMULA USED:**\n\nBODMAS \n\n \n \n\n B\n Brackets in order\n \n \n(),{}.[ ]\n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n O\n **Of**\n of\n \n \n\n D\n **Division**\n ÷\n \n \n\n M\n **Multiplication**\n ×\n \n \n\n **A**\n **Addition**\n +\n \n \n\n **S**\n **Subtraction**\n -\n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n**CALCULATION:**\n\n6/5 ÷ 6/5 of 6/5 × 5/6 + 9/4 ÷ 4/5 of 15/2 - { 85 over 9 + ( 4/3 + 5/3 of 6/25)}\n\n⇒ 6/5 ÷ 6/5 of 6/5 × 5/6 + 9/4 ÷ 4/5 of 15/2 - { 85 over 9 + ( 4/3 + 2/5)}\n\n⇒ 6/5 ÷ 6/5 of 6/5 × 5/6 + 9/4 ÷ 4/5 of 15/2 - { 77/9 + 26/15}\n\n⇒ 6/5 ÷ 36/25 × 5/6 + 9/4 ÷ 6 - 463/45\n\n⇒ 5/6 × 5/6 + 3/8 - 463/45\n\n⇒ 25/36 + 3/8 - 463/45\n\n⇒ (77/72) - (463/45)\n\n⇒ ( 385 - 3704)/360 = -3319/360 = - 979 over 360\n\n**Hence, the required value is - 979 over 360**",
